									<div class="content-box"><div class="text"><p><span class="TextRun SCXW135144088 BCX0" lang="EN-US" xml:lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW135144088 BCX0">At </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW135144088 BCX0">Sukhwani</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW135144088 BCX0"> Associates, our enduring success is rooted in a set of unwavering core values that have shaped our journey for over <span data-contrast="auto">4 decades</span>. These principles form the foundation of our group, defining who we are and how we </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW135144088 BCX0">operate</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW135144088 BCX0">.</span></span><span class="EOP SCXW135144088 BCX0" data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}"> </span></p></div></div>								</div>
