				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<div class="content-box"><div class="text"><p><span data-contrast="none">Presenting Mr. Sagar Gurmukh Sukhwani, the luminary propelling Sukhwani Associates into an extraordinary future. He epitomizes the backbone of Sukhwani Associates, encapsulating a legacy defined by excellence, innovation, and an unwavering pursuit of perfection in crafting living spaces.</span> <span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:0,&quot;335551620&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:300,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}"> </span></p><p> </p><p><span data-contrast="none">As a second-generation leader, Sagar personifies an unparalleled commitment, passion, and renowned expertise that distinguishes Sukhwani Associates in the real estate realm.  His leadership is not merely about structures; it&#8217;s a testament to the seamless fusion of design and functionality, creating living spaces that transcend the ordinary.</span> <span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:300,&quot;335559739&quot;:300,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}"> </span></p></div></div>								</div>
